          "title": "Welcome to Linguistics",
          "content": "Linguistics is the scientific study of human language. It examines how language is structured, how it's used, how it changes, and what makes it uniquely human. Unlike learning a specific language, linguistics asks deeper questions: What is language? How does it work in the mind? Why do all human languages share certain features?",
